# Deep Learning Computer Vision Engineering (`computer-vision-deep-learning`)

The `computer-vision-deep-learning` skill provides end-to-end architecture, optimization, and deployment patterns for modern neural computer vision models across edge devices, servers, and local GPU workstations.

---

