## 2. Core Model Families & Capabilities

### A. Object Detection & Instance Segmentation
* **YOLOv8 & YOLOv11 (Ultralytics)**: Real-time detection, oriented bounding boxes (OBB), and instance segmentation masks. Capable of 60–140 FPS on modern NVIDIA GPUs.
* **RT-DETR (Real-Time DEtection TRansformer)**: End-to-end transformer detection eliminating manual NMS tuning.
* **Segment Anything 2 (SAM 2)**: Promptable zero-shot mask segmentation via point prompts, bounding boxes, or text.

### B. Vision-Language & Zero-Shot Models
* **Florence-2**: Unified vision foundation model for dense region captioning, open-vocabulary grounding, and OCR.
* **Moondream2**: Ultra-lightweight 1.6B parameter multimodal model for fast edge visual question answering.
* **CLIP (Contrastive Language-Image Pre-training)**: Zero-shot visual classification and semantic image retrieval.

### C. Multi-Object Tracking (MOT)
* **ByteTrack**: Associates every detection box (both high and low confidence) to maintain track continuity across occlusions and motion blur.

